{
 "id": "f8c98885-7da1-4a6f-9954-74cd8350c9e4",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "I Regressed, but the World didn’t End"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "회귀했는데 세상이 안 망함"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Lee Do-hyeok returned to the past to save the world. He was told to prepare as much as possible.\n\nBut… the world isn’t ending. Now all that’s left for Do-hyeok is a mountain of debt.\n\n\"I’ll pay you a salary, so just help me with my game streaming!\"\n\n... And so, he started game streaming. But for some reason, it’s way too easy?\n\nWatch a former hero’s debut as a game streamer!",
   "ko": "세상을 구원하기 위해 과거로 돌아왔다.\n\n그런데.. 세상이 안 망한다. 도혁에게 남은 건 산더미처럼 쌓인 빚뿐.\n\n“월급 줄 테니까 게임방송이나 도와줘!”\n...그래서 시작한 게임방송이 너무 쉽다.\n\n전직 용사의 게임 스트리머 데뷔물."
  },
